@gateway = http://localhost:7002

### Create a payment session (replaying the same key returns the same session)
# @name session
POST {{gateway}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-session-0001

{
  "merchantRef": "demo-booking-1",
  "amountCents": 30000,
  "returnUrl": "http://localhost:5210/",
  "webhookUrl": "http://localhost:7001/webhooks/gateway",
  "expiresAt": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Open this in a browser to pay: {{session.response.body.payUrl}}
GET {{gateway}}/pay/{{session.response.body.id}}

### Status API: what a merchant asks when it never heard back
GET {{gateway}}/sessions/{{session.response.body.id}}

### Pay without the page (tests and Lab); outcome approve or decline
POST {{gateway}}/sessions/{{session.response.body.id}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "approve" }

### Refund (once per session; same key again is harmless)
POST {{gateway}}/sessions/{{session.response.body.id}}/refund
Idempotency-Key: demo-refund-0001

### The session with every webhook attempt
GET {{gateway}}/admin/sessions/{{session.response.body.id}}

### Recent sessions
GET {{gateway}}/admin/sessions

### Lab: slow bank, lost webhooks, duplicates, no redirect back
PUT {{gateway}}/admin/switches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slowPayMs": 0, "dropWebhooks": false, "duplicateWebhooks": false, "redirectBack": true }

### Back to defaults
PUT {{gateway}}/admin/switches/reset
